  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Requirements</strong> You are in Black Powder Stance.</p><hr></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">You can rain fire on an enemy when you need to. When you use Flurry of Blows, you can substitute a Strike with an Interact action to Reload a simple firearm. You do not need a free hand to reload your firearm in this way. In addition, you can use Flurry of Blows with two actions; when you do, you can Interact to Reload and Strike with a simple firearm with each action, in an order of your choice.</p>"
